    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s a highly polished puzzle game with lovely visuals, calming music and a math mechanic that starts simple and becomes very complex.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201cHexologic is a charming number puzzle game that gets some influence from games like Sudoku. The sights and sounds are clearly meant to invoke tranquility, which adds to the peaceful atmosphere and gameplay.\u201d<br>80/100 \u2013 Gaming Trend<br><br>\u201cHexologic absolutely blew me away and was better than anything I expected it to be! I never thought I could love a casual puzzle game as much as I\u2019ve loved this one\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 The Insatiable Gamer<br>",
